  B1 (FIXED): `requested_entry_time()` ignores `bounds_override`
    - Uses `train.bounds` (original timetable) for `earliest_allowed`
    - Uses `train.planned.arr` for "plan"+"plan+N" offsets
    - For delayed trains: `planned_arr` is in the past → all 6 entry choices collapse
      to `earliest_allowed` → 6 logits map to 1 unique schedule → PPO gradient diluted
    - Entry picks (idx 0-5): uniform distribution confirms policy can't differentiate
    - Also affects on-time partial trains (G1487, etc.) where pre-origin stations
