    critic only runs during update (batch≥256). Our critic runs during both
    collection (batch=1) and update (batch=256). LayerNorm is batch-size agnostic
    and handles heterogeneous input scales (seconds vs priorities vs bits).
    LocalCritic: 230-dim input, LayerNorm(230) → _mlp(230, 128, 1)
    GlobalCritic: 14-dim input, LayerNorm(14) → _mlp(14, 128, 1)

