Rationale: GPU_8_9 MADDPG project showed three techniques that directly apply:
  progressive delay penalty prevents the policy from tolerating large delays;
  input normalization stabilizes critic training with heterogeneous feature
  scales; entropy scheduling gives more structured exploration.
